---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="关于" description="写给来到这里的你的信，关于小志的工作方式、兴趣爱好和联系方式。">
  <main class="letter-page">
    <article class="about-letter" aria-label="写给来访者的信">
      <div class="letter-stamp" aria-hidden="true">
        <img src="/images/about-character.svg" alt="" width="128" height="122" />
        <span>小志的书桌</span>
      </div>

      <header class="letter-head">
        <p>关于我</p>
        <h1>给来到这里的你</h1>
        <time datetime="2026-06-05">2026年6月5日</time>
      </header>

      <div class="letter-line" aria-hidden="true"></div>

      <div class="letter-body">
        <p class="salutation">亲爱的来访者：</p>
        <p>
          很高兴你打开这个页面。这里不像一份正式简历，更像我夹在网站里的一封信：慢一点说清楚我是谁、我在做什么，以及我为什么愿意把这些东西长期写下来。
        </p>
        <p>
          如果你是从一篇文章、一个项目，或者某个搜索结果来到这里，希望这封信能帮你更快认识这个网站背后的人。
        </p>

        <section class="letter-section" aria-labelledby="about-introduction">
          <h2 id="about-introduction">我是谁</h2>
          <p>
            你好，我是小志，一名喜欢把想法做成页面、工具和长期内容系统的前端开发者。这个网站是我的公开工作台，我会在这里整理技术文章、记录生活点滴，也把个人项目的迭代过程留下来。
          </p>
          <p>
            我偏爱清晰、耐看的界面，也喜欢把复杂问题拆成能一点点完成的小步骤。比起追求炫技，我更在意作品能不能长期维护、长期被自己使用。
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="letter-section" aria-labelledby="about-hobbies">
          <h2 id="about-hobbies">我喜欢什么</h2>
          <div class="letter-notes">
            <section>
              <h3>游戏</h3>
              <p>游戏经常给我新的灵感：关卡节奏、任务反馈、界面提示和世界观细节，都能反过来帮助我理解产品体验。</p>
            </section>
            <section>
              <h3>写作</h3>
              <p>我喜欢把学到的东西写下来。写作会逼着我把含糊的经验重新组织成清楚的判断，也方便以后回头复盘。</p>
            </section>
            <section>
              <h3>分享</h3>
              <p>我希望这个网站不只是作品展示，也是一处能交换想法的地方。技术、生活、项目踩坑，都可以慢慢沉淀在这里。</p>
            </section>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="letter-section letter-postscript" aria-labelledby="about-postscript">
          <h2 id="about-postscript">附言</h2>
          <p>如果你想聊聊技术文章、个人网站、项目想法，或者只是打个招呼，可以从下面这些地方找到我。</p>
          <ul class="contact-list">
            <li>
              <span>QQ</span>
              <a href="/images/qq-qr.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">扫码联系</a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span>微信</span>
              <a href="/images/wechat-qr.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">扫码联系</a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span>邮箱</span>
              <a href="mailto:1900074789@qq.com">1900074789@qq.com</a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span>GitHub</span>
              <a href="https://github.com/OpFi" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">github.com/OpFi</a>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </section>
      </div>

      <div class="letter-signature" aria-label="署名">
        <span>小志</span>
        <time datetime="2026-06-05">写于 2026年6月5日</time>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .letter-page {
    min-height: 100%;
    padding: 2rem 1.25rem 4rem;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 10% 8%, rgba(187, 247, 208, 0.38), transparent 32%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(246, 252, 244, 0.96), rgba(250, 253, 247, 0.94)),
      var(--paper);
    color: #173528;
  }

  .about-letter {
    position: relative;
    width: min(100%, 62rem);
    margin: 0 auto;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid rgba(21, 128, 61, 0.18);
    border-radius: 12px;
    background:
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(21, 128, 61, 0.07) 0 1px, transparent 1px 100%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(21, 128, 61, 0.05) 0 1px, transparent 1px 2.35rem),
      linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.98), rgba(249, 253, 248, 0.96));
    background-size: 100% 100%, 100% 2.35rem, 100% 100%;
    box-shadow:
      0 24px 60px rgba(20, 83, 45, 0.1),
      inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
    padding: 3rem;
  }

  .about-letter::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0 auto 0 2.1rem;
    width: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent, rgba(21, 128, 61, 0.2) 10%, rgba(21, 128, 61, 0.2) 88%, transparent);
  }

  .about-letter::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    right: 0;
    top: 0;
    border-style: solid;
    border-width: 0 4.6rem 4.6rem 0;
    border-color: transparent rgba(220, 252, 231, 0.78) transparent transparent;
    filter: drop-shadow(-0.4rem 0.4rem 0.8rem rgba(20, 83, 45, 0.08));
  }

  .letter-stamp {
    position: absolute;
    right: 2.6rem;
    top: 2rem;
    z-index: 1;
    display: grid;
    justify-items: center;
    gap: 0.25rem;
    width: 8rem;
    rotate: 4deg;
    color: rgba(20, 83, 45, 0.58);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .letter-stamp img {
    width: 6.2rem;
    height: auto;
    opacity: 0.88;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 0.8rem 1.2rem rgba(20, 83, 45, 0.12));
  }

  .letter-head {
    max-width: 36rem;
    padding-right: 8.5rem;
  }

  .letter-head p {
    margin: 0;
    color: #3b7c52;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 850;
    letter-spacing: 0;
  }

  .letter-head h1 {
    margin: 0.65rem 0 0;
    color: #14532d;
    font-size: 3.35rem;
    font-weight: 950;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    line-height: 1.08;
  }

  .letter-head time {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 0.85rem;
    color: #6e8875;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
  }

  .letter-line {
    width: min(100%, 36rem);
    height: 1px;
    margin: 2rem 0 2.2rem;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(21, 128, 61, 0.36), transparent);
  }

  .letter-body {
    max-width: 48rem;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
  }

  .letter-body p {
    margin: 0.85rem 0 0;
    color: rgba(23, 53, 40, 0.84);
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.95;
  }

  .salutation {
    color: #14532d;
    font-weight: 850;
  }

  .letter-section {
    margin-top: 2.1rem;
  }

  .letter-section h2 {
    margin: 0 0 0.8rem;
    color: #123024;
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    font-weight: 950;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .letter-notes {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.8rem;
  }

  .letter-notes section {
    border-left: 3px solid rgba(21, 128, 61, 0.28);
    padding-left: 1rem;
  }

  .letter-notes h3 {
    margin: 0;
    color: #14532d;
    font-size: 1.08rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    line-height: 1.35;
  }

  .letter-postscript {
    border: 1px solid rgba(21, 128, 61, 0.16);
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: rgba(240, 253, 244, 0.56);
    padding: 1.15rem;
  }

  .contact-list {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.7rem;
    margin: 1rem 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .contact-list li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 4.5rem minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 0.9rem;
    align-items: baseline;
    color: rgba(23, 53, 40, 0.84);
  }

  .contact-list span {
    color: #166534;
    font-weight: 850;
  }

  .contact-list a {
    color: #285d40;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-color: rgba(21, 128, 61, 0.28);
    text-underline-offset: 0.28em;
  }

  .contact-list a:hover {
    color: #047857;
    text-decoration-color: rgba(4, 120, 87, 0.55);
  }

  .letter-signature {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    justify-items: end;
    margin-top: 2.6rem;
    color: #5f7a69;
    font-size: 0.94rem;
  }

  .letter-signature span {
    color: #14532d;
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    font-weight: 950;
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .letter-page {
      padding: 1.1rem 0.85rem 3rem;
    }

    .about-letter {
      padding: 1.35rem;
    }

    .about-letter::before {
      left: 1rem;
      opacity: 0.55;
    }

    .about-letter::after {
      border-width: 0 3.2rem 3.2rem 0;
    }

    .letter-stamp {
      position: relative;
      right: auto;
      top: auto;
      justify-items: start;
      width: 100%;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      rotate: 0deg;
    }

    .letter-stamp img {
      width: 5.4rem;
    }

    .letter-head {
      padding-right: 0;
    }

    .letter-head h1 {
      font-size: 2.2rem;
    }

    .letter-line {
      margin-block: 1.45rem 1.6rem;
    }

    .letter-body {
      padding-left: 0;
    }

    .contact-list li {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 0.18rem;
    }
  }
</style>
